@startuml component_diagram

!theme vibrant

title Component Diagram - xDuinoRails_MotorControl_bEMF

package "User Application" {
  [Arduino Sketch] as Sketch
}

package "Motor Control Library" {
  [Hardware Abstraction Layer (HAL) API\n<motor_control_hal.h>] as HAL_API
  [RP2040 HAL Implementation\n<motor_control_hal_rp2040.cpp>] as RP2040_IMPL
}

package "Pico-SDK (Arduino Core)" {
    [PWM Hardware Driver] as PWM
    [ADC Hardware Driver] as ADC
    [DMA Hardware Driver] as DMA
}

Sketch -down-> HAL_API : Calls
HAL_API <|-- RP2040_IMPL : Implements
RP2040_IMPL -down-> PWM : Controls
RP2040_IMPL -down-> ADC : Configures & Reads
RP2040_IMPL -down-> DMA : Manages

note right of Sketch
  The user's application, which
  includes one of the examples
  like SineWaveSpeed or a custom
  motor control logic.
end note

note left of RP2040_IMPL
  This component contains the
  RP2040-specific logic to
  interact with the hardware.
  It manages the MotorContext
  data structure.
end note

@enduml
